cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this report standard, layout or workflow, please cite it as below."
title: "maniva-reports. Technical reports from on-farm trial data in the maniva commons"
abstract: >-
  A report standard, a page layout and an R workflow that turn trial data in
  the tricot-data format into a technical report. The standard sets the
  sections, what each must show and how it is worded. The methods come from
  tricot-analysis-workflows. The repository works as a Claude skill and is
  readable by people and other AI tools.
type: software
authors:
